<slide>
  theme: midnight
  background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #14142b 0 24px, #191936 24px 48px)
</slide>

<h2>Backgrounds: patterns</h2>

<p>
  Any CSS works, including <c>repeating-linear-gradient(...)</c>. Or point <c>background:</c> at an image
  file, as the cover slides of these decks do with <c>bg.svg</c>.
</p>
